{"`findMembers()` is called without awaiting its result, introducing a race condition. The template may render before members are available. Either return the promise from `setupController` or move the async call back to `afterModel`/`beforeModel` where the router will wait for it.": 0.9045248627662659, "`totalPages` is off by one when `user_count` is an exact multiple of `limit`, so the pager shows an extra page. Should use `Math.ceil(this.get(\"user_count\") / this.get(\"limit\"))` instead of `Math.floor(...) + 1`.": 0.9115353226661682, "Item-view template references `member`, but that alias is not available inside a separate `itemView` template. The row will render with missing member data, and clicking remove can throw when the controller calls `member.get(...)`.": 0.8854251503944397}